  "description": "Redis-backed distributed debate execution for the Delibera multi-model AI council framework. RedisDebateOrchestrator publishes every completed round to a Redis Stream so multiple workers can share one debate and survive each other's restarts; RedisDebateCache adds shared result caching with TTLs; DebateWorkerService consumes work in the background. Streams are created with a max length so they cannot grow without bound. Depends on Delibera.Core.",
